1
00:00:00,399 --> 00:00:06,194
Earth, Earth, are you going home?

2
00:00:06,194 --> 00:00:10,639
Damn, you're such a fucking kid.

3
00:00:10,762 --> 00:00:12,499
Go home.

4
00:00:20,107 --> 00:00:22,994
Earth, did you finish all that by yourself?

5
00:00:26,247 --> 00:00:28,812
Yeah, I finished it all.

6
00:00:31,679 --> 00:00:36,051
So Earth… what's going on?
You just showed up out of nowhere.

7
00:00:37,161 --> 00:00:39,807
Is there an open position at your shop?

8
00:00:41,440 --> 00:00:43,235
Why are you asking?

9
00:00:43,235 --> 00:00:47,075
I'm in debt to Gun for the alcohol…
so I want a part-time job.

10
00:00:49,557 --> 00:00:51,804
Why didn't I hear about this at all?

11
00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:56,466
Earth, if something's wrong
you can just tell me, you know?

12
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:01,296
So… can I take the job instead?

13
00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:08,431
Why? Is borrowing money
from me really that uncomfortable?

14
00:01:09,680 --> 00:01:13,968
It doesn't matter whose money it is.
I still have to pay it back anyway.

15
00:01:16,320 --> 00:01:24,570
Yeah… if you have a conscience, you pay people back—
unless the person who gave it doesn't want it back.

16
00:01:26,774 --> 00:01:29,640
What are you trying to say?

17
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:38,280
Think for yourself, you're grown.
Gun's your big brother… isn't he?
